                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Let\u2019s get real: the Big Ugly Bill is a slap in the face to South Texas senior citizens, veterans, children, and families. Packed with false promises and outright lies, it will hurt millions. This bill rips away health coverage, drives up food prices, makes education more expensive, harms our senior citizens, and threatens federal workers\u2019 retirements.",
