                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Unless Congress acts, tax credits that help South Texans afford health care will expire. Premiums will soar and many in our region will lose care altogether.\n\nI am committed to working across the aisle to ensure that does not happen. Seniors, veterans and families deserve access to affordable high quality health care!",
