                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Rising premiums aren\u2019t just numbers, they represent real struggles for real people. \n\nThat\u2019s why I remain firmly committed to ensuring that ACA tax credits do not expire, so South Texas families can continue to access the affordable healthcare they deserve https://t.co/2kC9DFLhx0",
