                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Health care isn't a partisan issue; it affects us all.\n\nI joined more than 30 House Democrats and Republicans in calling on the Senate to work with us to lower health care costs and protect ACA tax credits for millions of families. South Texans deserve affordable coverage.",
