                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Incredibly proud to share that Harlingen Medical Center has earned its 9th straight \u201cA\u201d from the Leapfrog Hospital Safety Grade for Fall 2025.\n\nAs I work in Congress to bring more health care support and resources to our  region, it\u2019s always great to see our hospitals receive much-deserved recognition for their commitment to the well-being of its patients and our community. Thank you for providing consistent quality service and care in South Texas!",
