                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "What happens when families who are living paycheck to paycheck are faced with skyrocketing health insurance premiums upwards of $16,000?\n\nThey go uninsured and forgo health care.\n\nSometimes early detection of illnesses can be the difference between life or death. South Texans shouldn't have to skip doctors visits because of bad Republican policies.",
